agent_prompt:
Finish my edit and give me the final video.

Edit file:    {edit}
Source video: {video}
Output:       {output}

Run: python tools/render_final.py --edit "{edit}" --out "{output}"
It cuts the keeps, applies the zooms, burns the text bursts and pop-up
cards, and mixes the sound effects — everything the ButaCut preview
shows (contract: butacut/edit-contract.md). If it fails, run
python tools/verify_setup.py, fix what it reports, and retry.
Then open the finished file so I can watch it.
